= Topology
#tags("topology")

#defn[
  A _topology_ $cal(T)$ on set $X$ is a collection of subsets of $X$
  that contains $emptyset$ and $X$ and is closed under unions and finite intersections.

  The tuple $(X, cal(T))$ (and, informally, $X$) is called a _topological space_.
]

#cite("munkers2000")[§2]